<title>USA: BellSouth Capital may issue $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>BellSouth Capital may issue $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BellSouth Capital Funding is expected to issue $300 million in 30-year debt via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to price as early as Friday and carries a put option in the fifth and tenth year, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
